{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invoker Tactics\u00a0</strong>is a roguelite deckbuilder  that combines turn-based strategy with unique skills and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather new units throughout your journey and use powerful upgrades to decks unique to each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your units  attack autonomously after each move you make. Choosing the right unit combos and having good positioning is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divers Build Options:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 100 different units, which\u00a0you'll earn after each successful battle, provide high levels of variety and inspire new combos and strategies each game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963750?t=1757853377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963750?t=1757853377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963750/f602841b36599f74162f10f224b4392f482e4355/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757853377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963750/f602841b36599f74162f10f224b4392f482e4355/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757853377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invoker Tactics\u00a0</strong>is a roguelite deckbuilder  that combines turn-based strategy with unique skills and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather new units throughout your journey and use powerful upgrades to decks unique to each run.</p><